sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor S as Student
    participant UI as Web UI (app.js)
    participant API as API route /api/orders
    participant OS as OrderService
    participant SS as SlotService
    participant R as Repository
    participant DB as SQLite
    S->>UI: Tap "Place order"
    UI->>API: POST /api/orders {canteen_id, slot_start, items}
    API->>API: requires("student") role check
    API->>OS: place_order(user, canteen_id, items, slot_start, now)
    OS->>OS: validate and merge cart lines
    OS->>SS: validate_slot(canteen, slot_start, now)
    SS-->>OS: slot time (or 400/409 error)
    OS->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    OS->>R: count_in_slot(...)
    alt slot full
        OS-->>API: Conflict slot_full
        OS->>DB: ROLLBACK
    end
    loop each cart item
        OS->>R: MenuRepo.get(item_id)
        R->>DB: SELECT
        Note over OS: check available and stock >= qty
    end
    OS->>R: UserRepo.get(user) to check wallet
    alt any check fails
        OS->>DB: ROLLBACK
        OS-->>API: Conflict (out_of_stock / insufficient_balance)
        API-->>UI: 409 + message
    else all checks pass
        OS->>R: create order, add items, reduce stock, debit wallet, log event
        R->>DB: INSERT / UPDATE
        OS->>DB: COMMIT
        OS-->>API: order with pickup token
        API-->>UI: 201 Created
        UI-->>S: Show token and status "Placed"
    end
